  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EPC- Peacebuilding Project in Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of the project are 1) improve the capacities of young women and men to lead grassroots peacebuilding initiatives and supporting youth-led advocacy and awareness campaigns promoting PCVE, 2) develop, deliver and evaluate a pilot project utilizing football for peace, tolerance and in inclusion, 3) create a communication strategy to raise awareness of the project and build support among stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
